<title>DENMARK: Danish Wise Men's report - main figures.</title>
<headline>Danish Wise Men's report - main figures.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of the main points from the Danish Wise Men's November forecast</p>
<p>(percent growth)				1996    1997   1998</p>
<p>GDP						  2.0     2.9    2.2</p>
<p>Inflation					  2.2     2.6    2.7</p>
<p>Wage costs					 4.1     4.5    4.7</p>
<p>Exports					    0.9     1.1    1.8</p>
<p>Imports					    1.9     2.9    2.6</p>
<p>Unemployment (thousands)		     245     236    245</p>
<p>c/a surplus (billion crowns)		 13.8    6.3    0.1</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969650</p>
</text>
